        {
            "title": "港股｜零跑第三季純利瀉73% 交付量創新高毛利率降至10.9%",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"港股｜零跑第三季純利瀉73% 交付量創新高毛利率降至10.9%\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"503\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/20345318f15d27cc99e59aefdd6321d86cd4233ba904bcb9dfd9a8f7bc749151/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fko%2Ffortune_insight_694%2Fdbddec0f78d2a1ab4bc25a6950c04ffb.png_up.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">港股｜零跑第三季純利瀉73% 交付量創新高毛利率降至10.9%</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">零跑汽車（09863）第三季純利按年大跌73%至4000萬元人民幣。期內收入增長63%至317億元人民幣，全球交付量升78%至310,052輛並刷新紀錄，惟原材料成本上漲及整車產品組合變動拖累毛利率回落3.6個百分點至10.9%，業績更由盈轉虧，錄得3000萬元人民幣經營虧損。季內出口按年急增2.64倍，集團在新能源乘用車市場份額升至7.2%。</p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E6%B8%AF%E8%82%A1-%E9%9B%B6%E8%B7%91%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E5%AD%A3%E7%B4%94%E5%88%A9%E7%80%8973-%E4%BA%A4%E4%BB%98%E9%87%8F%E5%89%B5%E6%96%B0%E9%AB%98%E6%AF%9B%E5%88%A9%E7%8E%87%E9%99%8D%E8%87%B310-9-113053380.html",
